    description: "Per WI-vobiv-kivop investigation 2026-04-26 on cohort cohort-001/iter-001 (deep-20260425-210357): alertmanager has 39 external_symbol nodes with language='unresolved'. Question: is 'unresolved' an intentional sentinel value when the source language can't be determined, or is it a leak from somewhere? If sentinel — add 'unresolved' to the explicit allowed-sentinel set in the INV-nodij validator so it stops being flagged. If leak — trace the producer and fix it. Lower priority than the other three INV-nodij sub-items (RST, jsonnet, kafka) because the volume is smaller and the right resolution is most likely just 'add to allowed sentinels'."  # e1f4
